Error [jet.MatrixShapeMismatch]: Matrix multiplication needs equal inner sides, but these are 4 and 5
  --> Tests/UI/matrix_measure_inner_mismatch.jet:2:62
    |
  2 | multiply: fn(left: Matrix<3, 4>, right: Matrix<5, 2>) { bad: left * right }
    |                                                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The left column measure must match the right row measure
 Fix: Use `Matrix<3, 4> * Matrix<4, 2>`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2512
